<title>POLAND: KOMUNALNY APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 609,000.</title>
<headline>KOMUNALNY APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 609,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.61 vs    0.57</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.99 vs    0.69</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  1.73 vs    1.08</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 3.74 vs    2.54</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  2.70 vs    2.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    4.09 vs    3.17</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  6.63 vs    9.82</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	14.61 vs    9.60</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Komunalny SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
